aman sentosa. -</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والمقام الأمين موضع الإقامة والأمين الآمن من كل سوء وآفة ومكروه وهو الذي قد جمع صفات الأمن كلها فهو آمن من الزوال والخراب وأنواع النقص وأهله آمنون فيه من الخروج والنغص والنكد<cite>«حادي الأرواح إلى بلاد الأفراح» 1/100</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s44a51\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/44-49.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (44:49)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/44-56.html\">Ayat seterusnya (44:56)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/44-56.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Ad-Dukhaan 44:56 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Mereka tidak merasai kematian dalam Syurga itu selain daripada mati yang mereka rasai (di dunia) dahulu; dan Allah selamatkan mereka dari azab neraka;\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/44-56.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Ad-Dukhaan 44:56 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Mereka tidak merasai kematian dalam Syurga itu selain daripada mati yang mereka rasai (di dunia) dahulu; dan Allah selamatkan mereka dari azab neraka;\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Laman utama\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Ad-Dukhaan\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/44.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 56\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/44-56.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/44.html\">Surah Ad-Dukhaan</a> › Ayat 56</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ad-Dukhaan 44:56</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿لَا يَذُوقُونَ فِيهَا الْمَوْتَ إِلَّا الْمَوْتَةَ الْأُولَىٰ وَوَقَاهُمْ عَذَابَ الْجَحِيمِ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Mereka tidak merasai kematian dalam Syurga itu selain daripada mati yang mereka rasai (di dunia) dahulu; dan Allah selamatkan mereka dari azab neraka;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">بل استعمل لفظ الذوق في النفي كما قال عن أهل النار: {لا يذوقون فيها بردا ولا شرابا} أي لا يحصل لهم من ذلك ولا ذوق.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 7/111</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا الاستثناء هو لتحقيق دوام الحياة وعدم ذوق الموت<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 1/326</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا من الاستثناء السابق زمانه زمان المستثنى منه<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/70</cite></blockquote><h3>Apa yang beliau nukilkan daripada orang lain</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">بعضهم (إلا بمعنى بعد)</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «(إلا) بمعنى بعد والمعنى لا يذوقون بعد الموتة الأولى موتا في الجنة»<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/70</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s44a56\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/44-51.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (44:51)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/44-58.html\">Ayat seterusnya (44:58)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/44-58.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Ad-Dukhaan 44:58 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Maka sesungguhnya tujuan Kami memudahkan Al-Quran dengan bahasamu (wahai Muhammad), ialah supaya mereka (yang memahaminya) beringat dan insaf (untuk berima\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/44-58.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Ad-Dukhaan 44:58 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Maka sesungguhnya tujuan Kami memudahkan Al-Quran dengan bahasamu (wahai Muhammad), ialah supaya mereka (yang memahaminya) beringat dan insaf (untuk berima\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Laman utama\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Ad-Dukhaan\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/44.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 58\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/44-58.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/44.html\">Surah Ad-Dukhaan</a> › Ayat 58</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ad-Dukhaan 44:58</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَإِنَّمَا يَسَّرْنَاهُ بِلِسَانِكَ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَذَكَّرُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Maka sesungguhnya tujuan Kami memudahkan Al-Quran dengan bahasamu (wahai Muhammad), ialah supaya mereka (yang memahaminya) beringat dan insaf (untuk beriman dan mematuhinya).</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقوله: {ولقد يسرنا القرآن للذكر} أي لأجل الذكر كما قال: {فإنما يسرناه بلسانك لعلهم يتذكرون}<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/194</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s44a58\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/44-56.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (44:56)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}